+    \/ \E o \in Owners : SignalIfFatal(o)
     \/ \E a \in CallIds : \E w \in Work : \E o \in Owners : AddTask(a, w, o)
     \/ \E a \in CallIds : TrySyncMatchFallback(a)
     \/ \E a \in CallIds : \E p \in Pollers : TrySyncMatch(a, p)
